@startuml

actor Client
participant "app.js" as App
participant "products.js" as Products
collections "pizzas[]" as Pizzas

== Création d'une pizza ==

Client -> App : POST /api/products
App -> Products : Transmet la requête

Products -> Products : Récupère les données du body
Products -> Products : Crée newPizza

Products -> Pizzas : pizzas.push(newPizza)
Pizzas --> Products : Pizza ajoutée

Products --> Client : 201 Created + JSON

@enduml